stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> Discovered
 Discovered --> MetadataOnly: no authorized content
 Discovered --> Queued: authorized input
 Queued --> Downloading
 Downloading --> Transcribing
 Transcribing --> Indexing
 Indexing --> Ready
 Downloading --> Waiting: network or system
 Transcribing --> Waiting: assets, power or resources
 Waiting --> Queued: permitted resume
 Transcribing --> Partial: some committed evidence
 Partial --> Queued: continue
 Ready --> Stale: media revision changed
 Stale --> Queued: reanalyze
 Queued --> Cancelled: user
